# Supabase — Project Settings → Data API (URL) and API Keys (anon/publishable).
# Both are NEXT_PUBLIC_ on purpose: they ship to the browser. The anon key is
# designed to be public; row level security is what protects the data. Never
# put the service_role key in a NEXT_PUBLIC_ variable, or in this project at all.
#
# Copy to .env.local for development, and add the same two to your Vercel
# project settings for production.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
